title: The daily check covers the time since the last daily check, not the calendar day.
pid: 5d568c80-125b-497c-b5e6-bf574d9a6a66
body: |2-
  The pacer checks once per UTC date, at the first loop after midnight
  that is not inside a session, so one window ends where the next
  begins and nothing falls between. Its first run only records where
  the first window starts.
